<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#8220;<B>Organizational
Documents</B>&#8221; means, with respect to any Person that is an entity, its certificate of incorporation or formation, bylaws, operating
