the resale of such security that is effective under the Securities Act, (ii)&nbsp;following any sale of such Shares pursuant to Rule&nbsp;144,
(iii)&nbsp;if such Shares are eligible for sale under Rule&nbsp;144, without the requirement for the Company to be in compliance with
the current public information required under Rule&nbsp;144 as to such Shares without volume or manner of sale restrictions, or (iv)&nbsp;if
in the opinion of counsel to the Company, such legend is not required under applicable requirements of the Securities Act (including
judicial interpretations and pronouncements issued by the staff of the Commission).</P>

