<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The Company agrees that at
and after such time as the Company is obligated to issue Shares without legends pursuant to the first paragraph of this <U>Section&nbsp;4.1(c)</U>,
it will, no later than the earlier of (i)&nbsp;one (2)&nbsp;Trading Day and (ii)&nbsp;the number of Trading Days comprising the Standard
