counsel or the Transfer Agent with respect to the book entry position representing the Shares issued with a restrictive legend, instruct
its counsel to issue a legal opinion to the Transfer Agent if required by the Transfer Agent to effect the removal of the legend hereunder
and promptly thereafter, deliver or cause to be delivered to such Purchaser a statement evidencing the book entry position representing
such shares that is free from all restrictive and other legends. The Company may not make any notation on its records or give instructions
